      "text": "User will go to  -> Streamlit\nStreamlit will go to -> Friday\nFriday will show features and take inputs-> Prompt\nPropmt will go through -> gemini/grok 4.1 \nGemini/Openrouter/Grok4.1 will generate response-> \nResponse -> Friday saves responses to Memory\nMemory -> remembers conversation\nUI -> Stramlit displays it",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "User will go to  -> Streamlit\nStreamlit will go to -> Friday\nFriday will show features and take inputs-> Prompt\nPropmt will go through -> gemini/grok 4.1 \nGemini/Openrouter/Grok4.1 will generate response-> \nResponse -> Friday saves responses to Memory\nMemory -> remembers conversation\nUI -> Stramlit displays it",
