      "text": "ToDo -\neverything revolves around memory -\nI'll build the memory first - assistant/memory.py\nBuild structured propmts in prompt_controller\nIf tomorrow I switch Gemini to Grok, what should change?\nMy llm_engine file should handle this efficiently\n\n\n\n\n",
